<description>&lt;p&gt;Drone strikes and artillery fire from Myanmar are now reaching Thai border villages in Tak and Mae Sot, prompting Thai troops to fire warning shots and close unofficial border trade for seven days. Thai authorities have arrested two Singaporeans and three Thais for a cross-border prostitution network, seized 2.74 million meth pills hidden in furniture, and detained six Cambodians for illegal crossing. Chinese nationals were rescued by police in Tak province before being trafficked to a Myanmar call centre, while border locals in Tak seek protection as the Karen State conflict intensifies. 35 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitwFBVV95cUxQZVliMWhfUjVkT3hjSTdLNzlXVUVndlBoWmlSU0loRHNwTVNQVXdCbzlwNmV1WDRHRmlaSk5tcWdQcU9ORlZxM1FXVUxVR1ktZFpXLVYtSzRMbnN6bFg4T3lsMHZ3Zno5VE96Z0dicC03ZlFEN1M1SGVhazdzQm9uZ0tNM2RrQkVCWnpZU0NoV3FPUndQZzVSZF9WTVBHeGFBSXlNT2k2WnR5UW45YjVpeWRHMk5mU00?oc=5&quot;&gt;Pattaya Mail&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Thai Examiner&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Khaosod English&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Gulf News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijAFBVV95cUxQbHFOdVk4T1lDRkY3b000RUxJdEFoN3BSdGUwUEJ1N2VJVnFTZzRHSXFiU0F3akNFQWxYNlhSVjgxSnZxSVh6YUV1eE5IeTktRHpzZk9wbWxocGlXVjljU0NWSnh4RkJNM2M2UGdaSjJmYlpRRHFTSFN0aUpxbDJMUVQ0YmUwdWdzOHZjMQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;9Now&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwgFBVV95cUxPS1FCVDU0eWNDeVZTNWl6RVpHekRzTE5fVmJaUDV6c3RMSGk2QVJ6bVAtdkw5elV4RDRUUnUzdmxTbWF5VDZoOWNuUTlGZWdxMXF4dURSWFFrSm1McGJTaWoyaERsNjVnbFFrclAycEh1dS04NGtJMU9OX1FSRDc1LU5UbkRyZThINXlfSndhWnJKM1FiUGNaZENKLU1jZXA5NmFFb1RlU1FXYmNHQ0xYX1NiRkJnOEtBMnluc3o0ZVhMZw?oc=5&quot;&gt;B